  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/6d/Coin.png/revision/latest?cb=20221215222116\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"A coin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"A coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/6d/Coin.png/revision/latest?cb=20221215222116\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"192\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>A coin</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Coins&#160;</b>are the main <a href=\"/wiki/currencies-2658\" title=\"Currencies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">currency</a>&#160;in Hay Day. They are used to buy almost every item and are needed to progress in the game.\n</p><p>Coins can be earned in various ways, though if players are completely stuck they can buy coins with real money.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Obtaining coins through in-game means</b></span></h3>\n<p>Players are given 350 coins at the start of the game. They can then obtain coins by:\n</p>\n<ul><li>completing <a href=\"/wiki/truck-2673\" title=\"Truck\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">truck</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">boat</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/town-13129\" title=\"Town\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">town</a> orders.</li>\n<li>selling items in <a href=\"/wiki/roadside-shop-2677\" title=\"Roadside Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">roadside shops</a> and to <a href=\"/wiki/visitors-7539\" title=\"Visitors\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">visitors</a>.</li>\n<li>finding them in <a href=\"/wiki/mystery-box-6452\" title=\"Mystery Box\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mystery boxes</a> (random)</li>\n<li>spinning the <a href=\"/wiki/wheel-of-fortune-2745\" title=\"Wheel of Fortune\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Wheel of Fortune</a> (random)</li>\n<li>popping <a href=\"/wiki/tom-2981\" title=\"Tom\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Tom</a>'s balloon (random)</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Obtaining coins using real currency</b></span></h3>\n<p>Players can also buy coins with real money. The below table illustrates the prices of each \"pack\" of coins. The number of coins the player gets in each pack seem to increase with the player's levels.\n</p>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Pack\n</th>\n<th>Price<br>(US$ and €)\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile of Coins\n</td>\n<td>0.99\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bag of Coins\n</td>\n<td>2.99\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sack of Coins\n</td>\n<td>7.99\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Box of Coins\n</td>\n<td>14.99\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chest of Coins\n</td>\n<td>29.99\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Trunk of Coins\n</td>\n<td>79.99\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Buying items</b></span></h3>\n<p>As there are far too many items in Hay Day to list in one article, it is best to refer to the <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/buildings-3577\" title=\"Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">buildings</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animals</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-animal-shelters-6565\" title=\"Category:Animal Shelters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animal shelters</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-trees-and-bushes-2601\" title=\"Category:Trees and Bushes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">trees and bushes</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/decorations-6168\" title=\"Decorations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">decorations</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/customization-29379\" title=\"Customization\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">customization</a> pages. The cost of these items may depend on the player's <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level and the number of identical items already owned.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=User%3ADarrenPaul%2FGuide%2FMoney\" title=\"User:DarrenPaul/Guide/Money\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Guide to get more money</a>&#160;by <a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=User%3ADarrenPaul\" title=\"User:DarrenPaul\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">DarrenPaul</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=User%20blog%3AMindoPod%2FBuy%20Low%20-%20Sell%20High.%20Using%20Tom%20for%20profit\" title=\"User blog:MindoPod/Buy Low - Sell High. Using Tom for profit\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Buy low - sell high: UseTom for Profit</a>&#160;by <a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=User%3AMindoPod\" title=\"User:MindoPod\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MindoPod</a>.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/currencies-2658\" title=\"Currencies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Currencies</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/chick-voucher-35503\" title=\"Chick Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chick Voucher\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/88/Chick_Voucher.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20211024200821\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/coin-6079\" title=\"Coin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/6d/Coin.png/revision/latest?cb=20221215222116\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"96\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Diamond\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/gift-card-16941\" title=\"Gift Card\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Gift Card\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/puzzle-piece-28177\" title=\"Puzzle Piece\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Puzzle Piece\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/token-31466\" title=\"Token\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Green Token\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Green Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-game-features-7440\" title=\"Category:Game Features\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Game Features</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831120239\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 398/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2625/2097152 bytes\n