  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Coin.png|A coin|left|200px]]\n'''Coins '''are the main [[currencies|currency]] in Hay Day. They are used to buy almost every item and are needed to progress in the game.\n\nCoins can be earned in various ways, though if players are completely stuck they can buy coins with real money.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n\n==='''Obtaining coins through in-game means'''===\nPlayers are given 350 coins at the start of the game. They can then obtain coins by:\n*completing [[truck]], [[boat]] and [[town]] orders.\n*selling items in [[Roadside Shop|roadside shops]] and to [[visitors]].\n*finding them in [[Mystery Box|mystery boxes]] (random)\n*spinning the [[Wheel of Fortune]] (random)\n*popping [[Tom]]'s balloon (random)\n----\n==='''Obtaining coins using real currency'''===\nPlayers can also buy coins with real money. The below table illustrates the prices of each \"pack\" of coins. The number of coins the player gets in each pack seem to increase with the player's levels.\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #ccc; margin: 1em auto; text-align: center;\"\n! scope=\"col\" style=\"background: #ddd;\"|Pack\n! scope=\"col\" style=\"background: #ddd;\"|Price<br />(US$ and €)\n|-\n|Pile of Coins\n|0.99\n|-\n|Bag of Coins\n|2.99\n|-\n|Sack of Coins\n|7.99\n|-\n|Box of Coins\n|14.99\n|-\n|Chest of Coins\n|29.99\n|-\n|Trunk of Coins\n|79.99\n|}\n----\n==='''Buying items'''===\nAs there are far too many items in Hay Day to list in one article, it is best to refer to the [[products]], [[buildings]], [[animals]], [[:Category:Animal Shelters|animal shelters]], [[:Category:Trees and Bushes|trees and bushes]], [[decorations]] and [[customization]] pages. The cost of these items may depend on the player's [[experience]] level and the number of identical items already owned.\n----\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\n*[[User:DarrenPaul/Guide/Money|Guide to get more money]] by [[User:DarrenPaul|DarrenPaul]].\n*[[User blog:MindoPod/Buy Low - Sell High. Using Tom for profit|Buy low - sell high: UseTom for Profit]] by [[User:MindoPod|MindoPod]].\n----\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Münzen\n|es = Moneda\n|fr = Pièces\n|it = Monete\n|no = Mynt\n}}\n[[ru:Монеты]]\n\n[[Category:Currencies]]",
